{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attention! This route is under active development. Currently built from Shepetivka to Dubno (110 km). In future updates, the entire section to Lviv (265 km) will be gradually completed, more objects, detailing and optimization will be added. The current price is preliminary and will increase after the completion of the main stages. All updates will be free for the owners of this route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Shepetivka - Lviv route recreates a real railway section in western Ukraine, passing through the territory of Khmelnytskyi, Rivne and Lviv regions. The planned total length of the route is 265 km. Currently, approximately 110 km has been built, including the Shepetivka, Zdolbuniv, Dubno stations and intermediate points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The line is fully double-tracked and electrified with alternating current (~25 kV). It provides intensive movement of passenger and freight trains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key infrastructure elements have been recreated: stations, crossings, platforms, catenary, signaling devices. The landscape of the route conveys the atmosphere of Volhynia and Galicia - forests, fields, villages, cities and water bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The route supports AC electric locomotives (e.g., ChS4, ChS4KVR, ChS8, VL80t) and suburban electric trains (ED9M). Users can create their own scenarios using the Content Editor available in ZDSimulator.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3894430?t=1754325843","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894430/8f19acf4d673759ad626f1fa0a6355556ed81ffb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754325843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894430/1c78a42f5b6ef21cd9e45fde9c32d2a414bba5f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754325843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894430/1c78a42f5b6ef21cd9e45fde9c32d2a414bba5f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754325843","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attention! This route is under active development. Currently built from Shepetivka to Dubno (110 km). In future updates, the entire section to Lviv (265 km) will be gradually completed, more objects, detailing and optimization will be added. The current price is preliminary and will increase after the completion of the main stages. All updates will be free for the owners of this route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Shepetivka - Lviv route recreates a real railway section in western Ukraine, passing through the territory of Khmelnytskyi, Rivne and Lviv regions. The planned total length of the route is 265 km. Currently, approximately 110 km has been built, including the Shepetivka, Zdolbuniv, Dubno stations and intermediate points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The line is fully double-tracked and electrified with alternating current (~25 kV). It provides intensive movement of passenger and freight trains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key infrastructure elements have been recreated: stations, crossings, platforms, catenary, signaling devices. The landscape of the route conveys the atmosphere of Volhynia and Galicia - forests, fields, villages, cities and water bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The route supports AC electric locomotives (e.g., ChS4, ChS4KVR, ChS8, VL80t) and suburban electric trains (ED9M). Users can create their own scenarios using the Content Editor available in ZDSimulator.</p>","developers":["ZDSimulator Team"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3381120","name":"ZDSimulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894430/375e2c7d05a4dc2b6a9f08866d43138c82388942/header.jpg?t=1754325843","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"ZDSimulator - Shepetivka-Lviv (to Dubno) Route","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["ZDSimulator Team"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"11 Aug, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894430/0e0e26456eb8cab99042a1babc0766675d29c68c/ss_0e0e26456eb8cab99042a1babc0766675d29c68c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754325843","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894430/0e0e26456eb8cab99042a1babc0766675d29c68c/ss_0e0e26456eb8cab99042a1babc0766675d29c68c.600x338.jpg?t=1754325843"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894430/11a207626a89cfa8cdb5d84e4037a420d0e823f0/ss_11a207626a89cfa8cdb5d84e4037a420d0e823f0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754325843","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894430/11a207626a89cfa8cdb5d84e4037a420d0e823f0/ss_11a207626a89cfa8cdb5d84e4037a420d0e823f0.600x338.jpg?t=1754325843"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894430/cb609e696a61b0b5b6c0b9e43f0940c79645b3a4/ss_cb609e696a61b0b5b6c0b9e43f0940c79645b3a4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754325843","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamst